    "turn_text": "And you have been involved. One of the areas you've been involved quite significantly is on the border. And I was wondering if it first of all is that part of the fact that so many ranches and those who own land right on the border are suffering from it. And really how bad has it been for those family run farms and ranches that are on the border?",
