    "turn_file": "/shared/3/projects/podcasts/transcriptionQueue/turns/pol_appearance_episodes_interviews/4/9/49002.jsonl",
    "turn_idx": 7,
    "turn_text": "And we often hear about the human toll of the migrants who are coming over here and that is something. Obviously to take into account as well, but you bring the human aspect of it of what it means for those on the US side of the border and those who own land. And I think many people who live on the border are asking what this administration is going to do. They've struggled to admit that it is a crisis, but yet the numbers are continuing to go up. As we look back at the year of 2021, how much has the migration to our country increased",
